flowchart TB
  accTitle: Spectra daily work: context, approval conditions, implementation and readiness
  accDescr: The recommended workflow separates preparation, specification approval, human or agent implementation, and validation. Approval stages advance in order; app work requires valid implementation approval. Manual eval is optional and not a prerequisite for verify, which runs release evals itself. Supporting commands do not form required workflow steps. Groups W1 to W5 have matching HTML explanations.
  subgraph WORK_PREPARE["W1 · Prepare context and intent"]
    direction TB
    ROUTE["COMMAND · route<br/>Select relevant references;<br/>no<br/>writes"]
    CONTEXT["COMMAND · context<br/>Read sources and refresh<br/>summary cache"]
    TASK["COMMAND · task<br/>Replace implementation brief"]
    ROUTE -.->|optional reference selection| CONTEXT
    CONTEXT -->|use loaded context to define intent| TASK
  end
  subgraph WORK_APPROVAL["W2 · Prepare specifications and approvals"]
    direction TB
    SPECS["HUMAN / AGENT WORK<br/>Prepare and review<br/>specifications"]
    STAGES["COMMAND · approve stages in<br/>order<br/>1. product-approved<br/>2. technical-approved<br/>3. implementation-approved"]
    GATE{"CONDITION · Valid<br/>implementation approval?"}
    SPECS -->|meaningful brief and valid contracts| STAGES
    STAGES -->|each preceding stage must remain valid| GATE
  end
  WORK_PREPARE -->|use recorded intent to prepare specifications| WORK_APPROVAL
  subgraph WORK_APP["W3 · Implement application changes"]
    APP["HUMAN / AGENT WORK<br/>Change application code and<br/>run project tests"]
  end
  WORK_APPROVAL -->|only with valid implementation approval| WORK_APP
  subgraph WORK_VALIDATE["W4 · Validate and assess readiness"]
    direction TB
    CHECK["COMMAND · check<br/>Validate Spectra structure<br/>and<br/>policy"]
    EVAL["OPTIONAL COMMAND · eval<br/>Run selected suite; write<br/>reports"]
    VERIFY["COMMAND · verify<br/>Recompute approval validity<br/>Check readiness and run<br/>release evals"]
    READY{"CONDITION · Readiness and<br/>release prerequisites satisfied?"}
    RELEASE["COMMAND · approve<br/>release-approved<br/>Runs verification again<br/>before<br/>approval"]
    CHECK -.->|optional selected suite| EVAL
    EVAL ~~~ VERIFY
    CHECK -->|assess release readiness| VERIFY
    VERIFY -->|reports result; may write even on failure| READY
    READY -.->|yes: request final approval| RELEASE
  end
  WORK_APP -->|recommended validation after changes| WORK_VALIDATE
  subgraph WORK_SUPPORT["W5 · Supporting commands"]
    direction TB
    STATUS["COMMAND · status<br/>Read current state; no<br/>writes"]
    INDEX["COMMAND · index<br/>Rebuild repository evidence<br/>cache"]
    FRESH["COMMAND · index --check<br/>Report freshness; no writes"]
    STATUS ~~~ INDEX
    INDEX ~~~ FRESH
  end
  %% Layout only: supporting commands are not a required next step.
  WORK_VALIDATE ~~~ WORK_SUPPORT
  classDef command fill:#f1eeff,stroke:#6c5ce7,color:#5143c6,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef condition fill:#fff5df,stroke:#8a5d00,color:#121827;
  classDef neutral fill:#f2f5fa,stroke:#64748b,color:#121827;
  class ROUTE,CONTEXT,TASK,STAGES,CHECK,EVAL,VERIFY,RELEASE,STATUS,INDEX,FRESH command;
  class GATE,READY condition;
  class SPECS,APP neutral;
